
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5041

# Identyfikatory z Dnia 9.
# Zachowaj swoje rzeczywiste wartości.
@productId = d034b22e-273b-4caf-bbbd-bcceda274570
@workCenterId = 97b1c0db-9fc7-4e09-9c0b-be90bcb00b22
@orderId = 40738c0b-6d6e-4e12-8981-eedabb3853f0


### 1. Utworzenie poprawnego zlecenia
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "PF-2026-001",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "workCenterId": "{{workCenterId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 120,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01"
}


### 2. Pobranie zlecenia po Id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json


### 3. Próba utworzenia zlecenia o tym samym numerze
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "PF-2026-001",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "workCenterId": "{{workCenterId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 200,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-15"
}


### 4. Błędna planowana ilość
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "PF-2026-002",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "workCenterId": "{{workCenterId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 0,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01"
}


### 5. Pusty numer zlecenia
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "workCenterId": "{{workCenterId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 100,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01"
}


### 6. Nieistniejący produkt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "PF-2026-003",
  "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "workCenterId": "{{workCenterId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 100,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01"
}


### 7. Nieistniejące stanowisko
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "PF-2026-004",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "workCenterId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "plannedQuantity": 100,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01"
}


### 8. Brak terminu zlecenia
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "PF-2026-005",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "workCenterId": "{{workCenterId}}",
  "plannedQuantity": 100
}


### 9. Pobierz wszystkie zlecenia
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json


### 10. Filtruj zlecenia Draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?status=Draft
Accept: application/json


### 11. Filtruj zlecenia Completed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?status=Completed
Accept: application/json


### 12. Filtruj według produktu i stanowiska
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?productId={{productId}}&workCenterId={{workCenterId}}
Accept: application/json


### 13. Wyszukaj fragment numeru
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?search=PF-2026
Accept: application/json


### 14. Sortuj malejąco według ilości
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?sortBy=plannedQuantity&sortDirection=desc
Accept: application/json


### 15. Pierwsza strona, jeden rekord
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=1
Accept: application/json


### 16. Druga strona, jeden rekord
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=2&pageSize=1
Accept: application/json


### 17. Połącz filtrowanie, wyszukiwanie i sortowanie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?status=Draft&search=PF&sortBy=number&sortDirection=asc&page=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json


### 18. Nieprawidłowy status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json


### 19. Nieprawidłowe pole sortowania
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?sortBy=createdAt
Accept: application/json


### 20. Nieprawidłowa paginacja
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=0&pageSize=101
Accept: application/json
